        "raw": "<p>The one area of Hero Character Creation I find myself stumbling around is the decision that certain Principles are only&nbsp;available if you pick a certain Background or Archetype. For example, if you have a Military background, you should have an Ideals Principle. Why not an Expertise or Responsibilities Principle? The idea that choosing Option A also locks you into Option B seems to run counter to everything else about this game, with its free form Build It How You Want it mentality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any issues of game balance that I am overlooking here?</p>",
