        "id": 228276,
        "name": "ddchasek",
        "username": "ddchasek",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ddchasek/{size}/1887_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-08-19T03:47:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Honestly it is the only retcon option I look at and say,” Yeah if you don’t like your choices provided here go ahead and take what you do want. This won’t take up your retcon.” Everything else extra power, increase red zone die size, extra red ability, and to a lesser extent dice swapping at least make sense that they are mechanically major enough to warrant the use of that part of character creation.</p>\n<p>Using it on a different principle just seems a bit wasteful.</p>",
